  "description": "Hyeon’s stagnant, aimless life takes a sharp turn when he stumbles into a job at the up-and-coming fashion brand “Larguer.” But one company dinner later, he wakes up next to the devastatingly handsome CEO, Ian, fully naked. Panic sets in, but Ian, ever composed and charming, shrugs it off and offers to mentor him in fashion design... with some extracurricular activities on the side. Is this a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity, a dangerously steamy romance, or a disaster in disguise waiting to unfold?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes 2 extra chapters.*",
